# generator: EUCLID and TURING play a live copy of the steps (the pattern stays as it was until COMMIT), settings per pattern in a lane
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap ARP
expect page Players
turn SELECT 1
expect page Weave
turn SELECT 1
expect page Generator
shot generator_off.png
# euclid: the mode, then its start values (no length of its own, a quarter of the pattern's 16: 4 hits)
turn K1 1
expect gen 2 1 1 0 4 0
# (the cycle repeats over the 64 steps: 4 hits in 16 is 16)
wait 100
expect genhits 2 16
shot generator_euclid.png
turn K2 4
expect gen 2 1 1 0 8 0
wait 100
expect genhits 2 32
turn K2 -5
turn K3 1
expect gen 2 1 1 0 3 1
shot generator_euclid_rotated.png
# the live copy is not the pattern: a step's note stays empty until COMMIT
expect note 2 1 1 0
# the Steps page before the commit: the live hits carry a star (the pattern's own steps would not)
tap SEQ
wait 50
shot generator_steps_live.png
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Generator
# COMMIT GENERATOR (the SEL list): the hits are written into the pattern (the root C4), the steps without one stay empty
tap SEL
wait 50
shot generator_list.png
tap SEL
wait 100
expect note 2 1 2 60
expect note 2 1 1 0
shot generator_committed.png
tap PLAY
wait 1200
shot generator_playing.png
# after the commit the hits are the pattern's own steps (no star); the live ones are on the Steps page above
tap SEQ
shot generator_steps.png
tap PLAY
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Generator
# turing: 16 bits, lock 50, density 50; it starts from the pattern's own steps (none: a seeded register)
turn K1 1
expect gen 2 1 2 16 50 50
wait 100
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot generator_turing.png
# the loop as long as it goes (64 bits, the pattern 16 steps): every slot of the grid should still get hits
tap PLAY
turn K2 48
expect gen 2 1 2 64 50 50
tap PLAY
wait 9000
shot generator_turing_64.png
tap PLAY
# saved with the project, in the pattern's lane: no format change
projsave 1
reboot
wait 400
expect gen 2 1 2 64 50 50
# off: the lane goes
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Generator
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
expect gen 2 1 0 0 0 0
